            "id": "1",
            "text": {
                "en": "People living with dementia deserve a say in whether AI tools are used in their care.",
                "zh-TW": "失智症患者應該對是否使用 AI 工具來照護他們擁有發言權。"
            },
            "totals": {
                "agreePct": 86,
