            "id": "2",
            "text": {
                "en": "Using AI to keep an elderly person company when no human is available is better than leaving them alone.",
                "zh-TW": "在沒有人陪伴的情況下，用 AI 來陪伴長者，好過讓他們獨自一人。"
            },
